# Output directories
#
# `output/benchmarks/reference/*.json` is the one deliberate exception: it is the
# committed benchmark record set (Tier6HybridRuntimePlan.md Sections 22.1, 32.9),
# curated evidence for the documented backend claims. Every ordinary `pixi run
# bench` run writes `output/benchmarks/<UTC timestamp>-<host tag>.json`, which
# stays ignored so a local benchmark never dirties the tree.
output/*
!output/benchmarks/
output/benchmarks/*
!output/benchmarks/reference/
output/benchmarks/reference/*
!output/benchmarks/reference/*.json
!output/benchmarks/reference/perf001/
output/benchmarks/reference/perf001/*
!output/benchmarks/reference/perf001/*.json
output/benchmarks/reference/perf001/*/
# `output/crossvalidation/` is the second deliberate exception: it is the
# committed Tier-2 cross-implementation evidence (Tier7JonesSciencePlan.md
# Section 29), which Section 34 places here by name. Only the record and its
# method note are tracked.
!output/crossvalidation/
output/crossvalidation/*
!output/crossvalidation/*.json
!output/crossvalidation/*.md
results/
plots/

# Sphinx build artifacts
src/build/
src/build/html/

